## 📖 About The Project

Finding a reliable plumber, electrician, or carpenter shouldn't be a hassle. **MindFind** is a modern, full-stack web application designed to bridge the gap between homeowners and skilled professionals. 

Whether you need a quick repair or a major renovation, MindFind provides a seamless experience to post requests, receive competitive offers, and communicate in real-time, all within a secure and intuitive interface.

### ✨ Key Features
- 👥 **Role-Based Access:** Dedicated dashboards for Clients, Workers (Tradespeople), and Administrators.
- ⚡ **Real-Time Chat:** Instant messaging between clients and workers powered by Socket.io.
- 📝 **Request & Offer System:** Clients post detailed job requests; workers submit competitive bids.
- ⭐ **Reviews & Ratings:** Build trust through a transparent feedback system.
- 📱 **Fully Responsive:** Beautiful, mobile-first UI built with Tailwind CSS.
- 🔒 **Secure by Design:** JWT authentication, password hashing, and protected API routes.

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Layer | Technologies |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Frontend** | React 18, Vite, Tailwind CSS, React Router, Axios |
| **Backend** | Node.js, Express.js, Socket.io |
| **Database** | PostgreSQL (with native SQL migrations) |
| **Deployment** | Nginx, Systemd, Let's Encrypt (HTTPS) |

---

## 🚀 Quick Start (Local Development)

Get the project running on your local machine in minutes.

### Prerequisites
- Node.js (v18 or higher)
- PostgreSQL (v14 or higher)

